        },
        "richtext_pXt3bT": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Join hundreds of people who stopped feeling guilty about never buying flowers and started just having them around. Get it for yourself, the office, a client, or someone special in your life! Available right now on Growing Wild’s online store. Order takes two minutes. Flowers show up automatically. Your mornings feel better. Your home feels like home.</p>"
